<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Gowing plans 5-for-1 share split.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Gowing plans 5-for-1 share split.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Menswear retailer Gowing Brothers Ltd said on Tuesday it would make a five-for-one share split.  </p>
<p>&quot;The share split should increase the liquidity of trading in the company's shares and help facilitate a more vibrant market for shareholders and potential investors,&quot; Gowing said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;Full details of the proposal will be included with the release of the interim results of the company in mid-March 1997,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>Gowing has 23.713 million shares on issue. The stock was 15 cents higher on Tuesday at A$5.20.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
